Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 11:28:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] JSON loads swift-async-stream and re-exports Async_Stream
 only under the new off-by-default Stream trait, which gates JSON.ND.stream
 and JSON.Parse.stream(ndjson:) (swift-compositions/swift-json#13)

---
 Package.swift                       |   8 +-
 Sources/JSON/JSON.Stream.swift      | 143 ++++++++++----------
 Sources/JSON/exports.swift          |   5 +-
 Tests/JSON Tests/Stream Tests.swift | 198 ++++++++++++++--------------
 4 files changed, 185 insertions(+), 169 deletions(-)

